<title>CANADA: Ulster Pete shr issue to gross C$36.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Ulster Pete shr issue to gross C$36.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ulster Petroleums Ltd said on Tuesday it had priced its previously announced issue of four million common shares, resulting in gross proceeds of C$36.6 million.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to fund Ulster's exploration and development programs in 1997 and 1998. Until needed for this, the funds will be used to reduce bank debt, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to close by December 23.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
